  "description": "Jin-U used to make video games. Now he's spent a century in another world, where the mysterious Blight is slowly swallowing it whole. Jin-U comes up with a desperate plan: turn the dying world into a video game. To people on Earth, Arsilan Saga is the most realistic VR MMORPG ever made. But the monsters are real, the NPCs are real, and the apocalypse is coming. Can Jin-U convince Earth's gamers to save a world they think is fantasy?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
